        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "d23deabbb9f71f2fdc052f5bed9cb754a8dd7a1aad3ed1621e608ceda1859571",
        "signing_date": "1987-11-24",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12616.txt",
        "text_sha256": "0feb7f32ecc9ce71b90a8708f23946ccbaca77f18589a1aa84c219834fe6b75e",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1987-12-09/pdf/FR-1987-12-09.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. Units and members of the Armed Forces of the United States will be \nused to suppress the violence described in the proclamation and to restore law \nand order in the vicinity of Atlanta, Georgia."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2244,
      "char_start": 1588,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:12616#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 149,
      "scope_id": "EO:12616#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "52 FR 46729, PDF pages 149-149",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "d23deabbb9f71f2fdc052f5bed9cb754a8dd7a1aad3ed1621e608ceda1859571",
        "signing_date": "1987-11-24",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12616.txt",
        "text_sha256": "0feb7f32ecc9ce71b90a8708f23946ccbaca77f18589a1aa84c219834fe6b75e",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1987-12-09/pdf/FR-1987-12-09.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. The Secretary of Defense is authorized to use such of the Armed Forces \nas may be necessary to carry out the provisions of Section 1. To that end, he is \nauthorized to call into the active military service of the United States units or \nmembers of the National Guard, as authorized by law, to serve in an active \nduty status for an indefinite period and until relieved by appropriate orders. \nUnits or members may be relieved subject to recall at the discretion of the \nSecretary of Defense.\nIn carrying out the provisions of this order, the Secretary of Defense shall \nobserve such law enforcement policies as the Attorney General may deter­\nmine."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2395,
      "char_start": 2245,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:12616#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3.",
      "pdf_page": 149,
      "scope_id": "EO:12616#sec3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "52 FR 46729, PDF pages 149-149",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "d23deabbb9f71f2fdc052f5bed9cb754a8dd7a1aad3ed1621e608ceda1859571",
        "signing_date": "1987-11-24",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12616.txt",
        "text_sha256": "0feb7f32ecc9ce71b90a8708f23946ccbaca77f18589a1aa84c219834fe6b75e",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1987-12-09/pdf/FR-1987-12-09.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. Until such time as the Armed Forces shall have been withdrawn \npursuant to Section 4 of this order, the Attorney General is further authorized"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2687,
      "char_start": 2397,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:12616#sec3-1",
      "kind": "item",
      "label": "(1)",
      "pdf_page": 149,
      "scope_id": "EO:12616#sec3-1",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "52 FR 46729, PDF pages 149-149",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "d23deabbb9f71f2fdc052f5bed9cb754a8dd7a1aad3ed1621e608ceda1859571",
        "signing_date": "1987-11-24",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12616.txt",
        "text_sha256": "0feb7f32ecc9ce71b90a8708f23946ccbaca77f18589a1aa84c219834fe6b75e",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1987-12-09/pdf/FR-1987-12-09.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(1) to coordinate the activities of all Federal agencies assisting in the suppres­\nsion of violence and in the administration of justice in the vicinity of Atlanta, \nGeorgia and (2) to coordinate the activities of all such agencies with those of \nstate and local agencies similarly engaged."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 3045,
      "char_start": 2688,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:12616#sec4",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 4.",
      "pdf_page": 149,
      "scope_id": "EO:12616#sec4",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "52 FR 46729, PDF pages 149-149",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "d23deabbb9f71f2fdc052f5bed9cb754a8dd7a1aad3ed1621e608ceda1859571",
        "signing_date": "1987-11-24",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12616.txt",
        "text_sha256": "0feb7f32ecc9ce71b90a8708f23946ccbaca77f18589a1aa84c219834fe6b75e",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1987-12-09/pdf/FR-1987-12-09.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 4. The Secretary of Defense is authorized to determine when Federal \nmilitary forces shall be withdrawn from the disturbance area. Such determina­\ntions shall be made in the light of the Attorney General’s recommendations as \nto the ability of civil authorities to resume full responsibility for the mainte­\nnance of law and order in the affected area."
    }
  ],
